.kotlin/

### Mac OS ###
.DS_Store

### client-inspector workspace ###
# Locally-built jars and decompiled sources from :client-inspector:sanitize/decompile/recompile.
data/
# Local Vineflower fork used via includeBuild; patches live in its own git repo.
vineflower/
# javac argfile dumps written during ad-hoc debugging
client-inspector/javac.*.args
# CMake intermediates for the Android HD native bridge.
/android/.cxx/
